# Insight label typography

Shared tokens on `.insights-page` and `.insight-detail`:

- `--insight-label-tracking: 0.08em` — date, article type, chips, filter pills, Insights eyebrow
- `--insight-meta-gap: 1.75rem` — space between date and type on the detail header

Do not invent a different letter-spacing for these uppercase micro-labels on one Insights surface and another. Change the token once; all consumers follow.
